          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "There are many materials through which you are not able to see at all. These materials are called "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "opaque",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ". Wood, cardboard and metals are examples of opaque materials."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.139,
            0.744,
            0.2
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The materials through which objects can be seen, but not clearly, are known as "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "translucent",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ". Butter paper and frosted glass are examples of translucent materials."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
